{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-fh-residency","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"fh-residency-forum-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","about":"FH Residency is a modern project by developer Forum, located in the Jumeirah Village area. Standing tall at 24 floors, it is designed for comfortable urban living. Its sleek architectural lines are subtly illuminated at night, creating a striking silhouette against the Dubai skyline.Stylish lobbies and corridors, done in a neutral color palette, blend elegance with contemporary design, immersing residents and guests in a hospitable and refined atmosphere.Studios, as well as apartments with 1, 2, or 3 bedrooms, are tailored for modern city life. Thanks to carefully crafted, modern, and stylish layouts, they offer the perfect blend of comfort and style.FH Residency boasts well-equipped gyms, outdoor sports facilities, a swimming pool, yoga and fitness studios, a children's playroom, and an outdoor playground for little ones. For the convenience of working residents, the complex offers a coworking area located on the 24th floor of the building.Its excellent location in the serene and green parks of Jumeirah Village Triangle (JVT) makes FH Residency an ideal home for those who value comfort.The transportation accessibility of the area allows FH Residency residents to reach Mall of the Emirates and Dubai Marina in 10 minutes, Downtown and Dubai Mall in 20 minutes, and Dubai International Airport in 25 minutes.","price":582750,"title":"FH Residency","bitrix":{"id":663,"pf_id":"are.2.13650","source":null,"project_id":"FH Residency","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"FH Residency","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Forum Group","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Triangle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1576/images/2024/04/02/340x252/W8CEpClRC11OgApDi1ncOYCFcFiTor3GmPYkUCtY.webp","464x312":"h